        "settings": {
          "agentToolDescription": "Books a Mobile field technician to visit the customer's registered address for hands-on diagnosis and repair. Use when RunLineDiagnostics reveals an issue that cannot be resolved remotely (e.g., hardware fault, cable damage, signal amplifier needed). Returns a ticket number, confirmed appointment slot, and technician assignment.",
